{"resourceIdentifier":"3046","resourceName":"BATMAN LANDFILL GAS (LFG) CAPTURE AND UTILIZATION PROJECT","description":"In order to develop a municipal solid waste management system that will be environmentally friendly and sustainable, Batman Landfill Gas (LFG) Capture and Utilization Project is being implemented by Anahtar Enerji Sanayi ve Ticaret Anonim Şirketi. The purpose of the project is to capture and utilize landfill gas for power generation.  The new gas extraction and utilization systems have been installed by the project owner. Before the implementation of the project activity, landfill gas that was captured and utilized by the project was emitted into the atmosphere directly. The project is located in Merkez District in the city of Batman, in southeast of Turkey. The waste deposition at the landfill in Batman is carried out since 2005.  The project activity is a Methane Gas Power Generating Plant with an installed capacity of 3,12 MWe. The project was commissioned  with generation of electricity from October 30th, 2020, which is regarded as the project start date. For the purpose of a sustainable waste management in which domestic wastes will be evaluated, it is planned to rehabilitate the Batman Solid Waste Disposal Site that receives around 127,750 tons/year, corresponding to an average of 350 tons per day of municipal waste coming from districts of Batman province and to generate renewable electricity power from landfill gas and the rehabilitation project was approved by the Ministry of Environment and Urbanization in Turkey. This project adopts a crediting period of 7 years. The expected average annual emission reductions are 59,642 tCO2eq/y. Accordingly, the project is expected to generate 417,494  tCO2eq emissions reduction throughout its first crediting period.","location":{"latitude":37.803283,"longitude":41.254840},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-05-23","endExclusive":"2022-06-23","endInclusive":"2022-06-22"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3046"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Batman"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3046"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"59642"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Energy industries (renewable/non-renewable sources)"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.D.,AMS-III.G."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Carbon Check (India) Private Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"02/02/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 30/10/2020 - 29/10/2027"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=63841&IDKEY=j8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0n88036739","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_BATMAN_LFG_Capture_Draft_Project_Description_rev01_2022-03-24.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-03-24T20:15:20.293Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=63822&IDKEY=aq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhk88010538","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Multiple Representation-v4.1-Batman LFG and Capture Project-16032022.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-03-24T16:33:46.263Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=84109&ID